 "item.yishu.qisha_token.note": "Token of the General Star. Your hand closes by itself; your feet stop hesitating.",
 "item.yishu.guiren_talisman.note": "Charm of the Noble One. When the road ends, someone happens to walk by.",
 "item.yishu.qinglong_talisman.note": "Charm of the Azure Dragon. Wind at your back, one step for two.",
 "item.yishu.baihu_talisman.note": "Charm of the White Tiger. Killing intent in hand — quick and merciless.",
 "item.yishu.shengmen_talisman.note": "Charm of the Gate of Life. Wounds close; hunger fades.",
 "item.yishu.kaimen_talisman.note": "Charm of the Gate of Opening. The world brightens and luck loosens.",
 "item.yishu.xiumen_talisman.note": "Charm of the Gate of Rest. Doing nothing is the best doing.",
 "item.yishu.ziwei_star_dust.note": "Fine powder sieved from astral ore; the bones of a Zi Wei chart.",
 "item.yishu.liuren_shell.note": "A divination plate; one piece serves one lesson.",
